        "load_cells": "Any compatible load cell(s) may be used provided a respective OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity exists, containing the load cell types and data required for the manufacturer's declaration of compatibility of modules. A load cell marked NH is allowed only if humidity testing to R76 has been conducted. Load cell transmission must conform to a standard type.",
        "air_cylinders": "Double acting type used with directional control valves having solenoid-pilot actuators and spring or pilot air return actuators."
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "controller",
